      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="684557982">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3339080">Gimli*/GeoJoce</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP319 Laurier Heights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most challenging thing about this one was crossing the lanes of traffic to get here.  :) Even on a Sunday morning there were just a few cars going by.  I made it and walked right up to this one.  The flagging isn't as neat as in a previous picture (the stake has collapsed) but well marked nonetheless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was glad to grab this one and nab the three caps I called 'in the west end'.  It was time for me to head forward into 'park country'.  lol  TFTBC!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="677605355">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-14T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1151545">Ringrat</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP319 Laurier Heights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One last cap before calling it quits for a couple of days. I've known this one was here for ages but have never made the leap across the traffic circle. It was flagged and staked recently so very easily located, but sure not easy to decipher!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="676486284">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-10T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3854161">Stonagal</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP319 - Laurier Heights.

Wondered if this traffic circle had a cache. Still not certain, but I do know it has a brass cap. Impossible to miss this one today, as the picture will show. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="659597325">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-07-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
